        <div class="rvl aiw">
          <img class="aimg" src="images/image-003.jpg" alt="O&amp;M Founders" width="480" height="640" loading="lazy"/>
        </div>
        <div class="rvr">
          <span class="ey">Our Story</span>
          <h2 class="H">Proudly Namibian.<br/>100% Women-Owned.</h2>
          <div class="rule"></div>
          <div class="wbadge">100% Namibian Women-Owned &amp; Led</div>
          <p style="font-size:.86rem;color:var(--S);line-height:1.84;margin-bottom:13px">Success is not always inherited; sometimes it is built from the ground up through faith, determination, resilience, and purpose.</p>
          <p style="font-size:.86rem;color:var(--S);line-height:1.84;margin-bottom:13px">O&amp;M Accountants and Consultants is founded by two women with a passion for numbers, a commitment to excellence, and an unwavering belief that every challenge presents an opportunity for growth. Our journey did not begin with a silver spoon. It began with a vision, hard work, sacrifice, and a deep trust in God&rsquo;s grace, plan, and purpose.</p>
          <p style="font-size:.86rem;color:var(--S);line-height:1.84;margin-bottom:14px">Dressed in pink, we proudly symbolize:</p>
