          </ul>
          <p style="font-size:.86rem;color:var(--S);line-height:1.84;margin-bottom:13px">Established in Walvis Bay in 2016, the firm has grown steadily across the Erongo Region and beyond, building a strong reputation for technical excellence and an unwavering commitment to client success.</p>
          <p style="font-size:.86rem;color:var(--S);line-height:1.84;margin-bottom:22px">Today, O&amp;M offers the full spectrum of bookkeeping, accounting, tax, payroll, business registration and business advisory services, with its head office in Walvis Bay and branches in Ongwediva and Windhoek.</p>
          <div class="vals">
            <div class="val"><h4>Local Expertise</h4><p>Deep knowledge of BIPA, NamRA, Social Security and Namibian tax legislation.</p></div>
